            Mobile Travel and News App
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Cross-platform Flutter app combining enterprise travel tools and
            internal communications into a single mobile experience.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-auto">
            <RiveTechIconGroup
              client:load
              size="large"
              icons={[
                { artboard: "flutter", label: "Flutter" },
                { artboard: "dart", label: "Dart" },
                { artboard: "html", label: "HTML" },
                { artboard: "css", label: "CSS" },
              ]}
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Project Card 5 -->
      <a
        href={`${base}projects/portfolio-case-study`}
        class="bg-surface-card border border-gray-dark/70 rounded-lg overflow-hidden hover:border-brand-orange/50 transition flex flex-col group"
      >
        <div class="aspect-video bg-gray-dark/30 overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src={`${base}images/portfolio-01.jpg`}
            alt="Video Platform Integration preview"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 flex-1 flex flex-col gap-3">
          <h3
            class="text-lg font-semibold group-hover:text-brand-orange transition-colors"
          >
            This Portfolio Page...
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
            Cross-platform Flutter app combining enterprise travel tools and
            internal communications into a single mobile experience.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-auto">

            <RiveTechIconGroup
              client:load
              icons={[
                { artboard: "astro", label: "Astro" },
                { artboard: "react", label: "React" },
                { artboard: "rive", label: "Rive" },
                { artboard: "tailwind", label: "Tailwind" }
              ]}
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Section -->
  <section
    id="about"
    class="snap-section max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 md:py-20 space-y-8 fade-section min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
      <!-- Profile Image -->
      <div class="flex-shrink-0 mx-auto md:mx-0">
        <div
          class="w-32 h-32 md:w-40 md:h-40 rounded-full border-4 border-brand-orange overflow-hidden bg-surface-card"
        >
          <img
            src={`${base}images/profile-large.jpg`}
            alt="Bryce Kennedy"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold">What I do</h2>
        <p>
          I'm a UX-minded engineer who has spent the last several years building
          and maintaining high-visibility internal tools, intranet platforms,
          and digital signage systems used across large organizations.
        </p>
        <p>
          My recent work at American Airlines focused on delivering reliable,
          scalable solutions using modern frameworks such as Angular, React, and
          Unily. I specialize in complex integrations, content management
          systems, and front-end architectures that help teams ship consistent,
          maintainable user experiences.
        </p>
        <p>
          Alongside my professional work, I enjoy exploring creative and
          experimental projects that blend technology and design — including
          building WordPress themes with Advanced Custom Fields, creating
          interactive animations with Rive, and experimenting with 3D modeling
          and printing.
        </p>

        <!-- Skills/Tech -->
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold">
            Tech & Tools I use
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm md:text-base">
            Technologies change quickly, and I stay adaptable by continuously
            learning and refining my toolset. Below is a snapshot of the tools
            and technologies I work with most often today:
          </p>
          <TechIconShowcase client:load size="large" />
        </div>
      </div>
